<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Urdu string catalogue.

  Every key in values/strings.xml must exist here. The CI localization parity
  check treats a missing Urdu key as a build failure (LOCALE-FR-001, REL-002),
  so this file cannot silently fall behind.

  PENDING DEP-011 / OD-016. The ~400 approved Urdu strings are Shehersaaz's to
  supply. What is here is structurally correct and reads naturally, and it is
  NOT a substitute for that review — see docs/implementation/mobile/20-mobile-open-issues.md.
  Nothing below is machine-translated word-for-word from the English; the Urdu
  is written as Urdu, which is why some lines are not literal renderings.
-->
